    "updated_at": "2021-10-25T19:22:47Z",
    "body": "Should consider how this relates to [HTTP link header preloads](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5988), as well as upcoming [103 Early Hints](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8297).\r\n\r\nFrom personal experience FOUC is a non-issue using the HTTP header equiv. Unsure about how the implementation differs, can't find spec.\r\n\r\n... also wondering potential fun edge cases /w stuff like `content-visibility` :D",
