    "created_at": "2021-11-13T00:13:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-11-13T00:13:31Z",
    "body": "The proposal has been updated: Instead of a boolean attribute, it's now a string attribute `blocking`. For this proposal, we allow only one value `blocking=\"render\"` to indicate render-blocking resource. The semantics and usage remain the same as before.\r\n\r\nThe syntax is intentionally left open for future extensions (so we may ultimately have something like `blocking=\"!parse render documentcontentloaded !load\"`).\r\n\r\nFor details, please refer to the [full version](https://gist.github.com/xiaochengh/fae2b549b3d37454beeb9028a829f4bd), which also has addressed some feedbacks that we have received so far.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/967739204/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
